+**Non-negotiable rules:**
+- Every glass element must have both `backdrop-filter` AND `-webkit-backdrop-filter`
+- Every glass element must have `@supports` fallback (solid background)
+- Every animated element must respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
+- Text contrast must pass WCAG 4.5:1
+- Blur values capped at 12px on mobile (`max-width: 768px`)
+- Never apply `overflow: hidden` to parent of glass element
+
+**Quality bar for each component:**
+- Does it look good on a vibrant animated background?
+- Does the hover/focus state feel responsive and tactile?
+- Are there at least 3 of the 6 layers present?
+- Does it hold up on a 375px mobile screen?
+- Would a user notice and delight in this detail?
