+**Code Pattern for Directional Borders**:
+```css
+.glass-card::before {
+  content: '';
+  position: absolute;
+  inset: 0;
+  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
+  border-radius: inherit;
+  mask-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%);
+  -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%);
+}
+
+.glass-card::after {
+  content: '';
+  position: absolute;
+  inset: 0;
+  border: 1px solid hsl(var(--hue-primary), 90%, 50%);
+  border-radius: inherit;
+  mask-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1));
+  -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1));
+}
+```
+
