+- **Non-Negotiable Rules**: Every glass element must have both `backdrop-filter` AND `-webkit-backdrop-filter`, `@supports` fallback, respect `prefers-reduced-motion`, WCAG 4.5:1 contrast, blur capped at 12px on mobile, never `overflow: hidden` on parent
