+## Part 10: Implementation Guidelines
+
+### Component Development Workflow
+
+1. **Read liquid-glass/README.md** - Understand the 6-layer composition
+2. **Find the technique** - Use "I Want to Build..." index to find relevant section
+3. **Build all 6 layers**:
+   - Background (animated blobs)
+   - Glass surface (backdrop-filter + fill)
+   - Border (directional highlights)
+   - Content (typography, inputs)
+   - Depth (stacking, shadows)
+   - Motion (hover, transitions)
+4. **Test on vibrant background** - Glass is invisible on flat backgrounds
+5. **Add accessibility** - Contrast, reduced motion, reduced transparency
+6. **Optimize performance** - Reduce blur on mobile, use containment
+
+### Quality Checklist
+
+Before marking any component complete, verify:
+
+- [ ] Has `backdrop-filter` AND `-webkit-backdrop-filter`
+- [ ] Has `@supports` fallback with solid background
+- [ ] Has vibrant background behind glass (gradient/blob)
+- [ ] Has directional border highlights
+- [ ] Has hover/focus state with motion
+- [ ] Respects `prefers-reduced-motion`
+- [ ] Respects `prefers-reduced-transparency`
+- [ ] Text contrast passes WCAG AA (4.5:1)
+- [ ] Blur reduced on mobile (≤12px)
+- [ ] No `overflow: hidden` on parent
+- [ ] Uses spring physics for animations
+- [ ] Maintains 60fps during interactions
+
+### Common Mistakes to Avoid
+
+1. **No vibrant background** - Glass on flat/white looks transparent
+2. **Missing `-webkit-` prefix** - Safari won't render glass
+3. **`overflow: hidden` on parent** - Destroys backdrop-filter context
+4. **Blur > 15px on mobile** - Performance issues
+5. **No contrast testing** - Text becomes unreadable
+6. **Animating blur** - Very expensive, avoid
+7. **No `@supports` fallback** - Breaks in older browsers
+8. **Ignoring `prefers-reduced-motion`** - Accessibility issue
+
+### File Structure
+
